{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Uinc97XXLr-p6iwlF3vcQg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:15.062897+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Uinc97XXLr-p6iwlF3vcQg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bmP7ibCColQk6rDNicfbxjmVWicIeutbZtdwgjJ13ib6aS34GGWQEnp0JrR3561vfJAA3xZzV2bOEUmcwoQOGSRW0ap0hSy0qxPTIbJRIpCF9NM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，激发青年学子的科研热情，帮助本科生深入了解我院学科特色、研究方向与科研环境，拓展对经济管理学科前沿的认识，电子科技大学经济与管理学院将于<span>2026年7月13日至16日</span>举办全国优秀大学生夏令营。本次活动将采取线上与线下相结合的方式进行。现将有关事项公告如下：</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动主题</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>管工融合筑基 数智拓界领航</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动定位</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次夏令营围绕管理科学与工程、工商管理学、应用经济学、金融等学科的前沿动态与产业实践，重点涵盖智慧运营与数智供应链、智能决策与优化、人工智能与商务智能、数智营销、企业数字化转型、金融科技与科技金融、数字经济与平台治理等方向。</span></p><p><span>活动设置学院推介、专业宣讲、名师讲座、学长分享四大环节，让同学们零距离感受我院学科优势、科研实力、育人特色及导师风采，对话学术大咖，明晰学术方向，规划成长路径。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>内容简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bmP7ibCColQnIicicUfYvVB8xUpozI7kBeHWX6thALIDcxktib4EZgx2kAYo3QO21licJeticvqPG7K69XDVBibgAwdpia90ia7RhKEHG5icKDSicftBTw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>参与方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 线上观看路径：关注“经彩视界”视频号，通过视频号进行直播，可提前预约</span></p><p><span>2. 线下参加地点：电子科技大学清水河校区经管楼C557</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询及意向登记方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.加入各专业咨询QQ群（请按报考意向选择）</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bmP7ibCColQmqaUMGlCVBzxnVXPgLNnOMD3le8mUxIzNWtIQa7p7b9icCiba7Hq8fwDzhiaTmKvStCdJas89YKd1aJOXWWIAREavpYernY4zULw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>2.　“优秀本科生选拔计划”意向登记</span></span></strong></p><p><span>扫描下方二维码完成个人信息登记，学院将于近期开启“优秀本科生选拔计划”报名工作，敬请关注后续通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bmP7ibCColQmoXx8yvibIpjNxorZGsSSyeAR9H8WvK4ySqv0u2Ehp5UibRQeZQPL6mXKHZ7saSiaLtMlJejIY7pPVojWHXlLfDL1tOibTaBgnZ3k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>3. 咨询方式</span></strong></p><p><span>咨询电话：028-61830919（李老师），028-61830913 （何老师），</span><span>028-61830920（刘老师）</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：yjsk-sme@uestc.edu.cn</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>六</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 夏令营活动为暂定计划，具体安排可能根据实际情况适当调整，请密切关注学院网站和各专业咨询QQ群信息。</span></p><p><span>2. 电子科技大学经济与管理学院研究生招生信息发布渠道：https://www.mgmt.uestc.edu.cn/jxxm/yjs/zsxx.htm</span></p><p><span>3. 电子科技大学经济与管理学院保留对本次夏令营活动的解释权。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>电子科技大学经济与管理学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月30日 </span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/bmP7ibCColQkGd0QzJFQ3ExL3cwtVM9d1Wweia06Rib2hz28BZjOOAXq1ibBDXdBaCsDmHQWVRNzCb6dgDmsEtJfyupCsqCv9CGANZwcOVWRFlE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e6918ce1127ac26a66edc98457cd3778d3a09b5ce495cb9d790834d463730717","textLength":804,"sourceSha256":"b78541263a60e65b4ae613e777e0ade70a4068ac319c2b8a1864de811a6ce8d4","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4892a7e08ce49e2b7850","title":"2026年电子科技大学经济与管理学院关于举办20